    <string name="privacy_policy">" Your privacy is very important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how X Game Booster (we, us, or our) collects, uses, and protects any information that you provide when using our mobile application.
 
 1. Information We Collect
 X Game Booster does not collect personal identification information such as your name, address, phone number, or email. However, the app may collect non-personal technical data from your device, such as device model, operating system version, and performance metrics, to optimize your gaming experience.
 
 2. Use of Information
 The information collected is used solely to improve the app’s performance and provide a better gaming experience. We do not sell, trade, or rent your information to third parties.
 
 3. Permissions
 To function effectively, X Game Booster may request certain permissions, including access to device storage, system settings, and running applications. These permissions are only used to enhance game performance and are not used for any unauthorized activities.
 
 4. Data Security
 We are committed to ensuring that your information is secure. We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
 
 5. Third-Party Services and Advertisements
 X Game Booster may include third-party services or advertisements to support our app. These third parties have their own privacy policies, and we recommend reviewing them as we have no control over their content or practices.
 
 6. Children’s Privacy
 Our app does not have a specific age rating and can be used by users of all ages. However, we do not knowingly collect any personal information from children under the age of 13. If we become aware that such information has been collected inadvertently, we will take steps to delete it promptly.
 
 7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
 We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
 
 8. Contact Us
 If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled, please contact us at bytecycleorg@gmail.com.
 
 By using X Game Booster, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to this Privacy Policy. "</string>
